OL,3,GNEWSAHealey due to leave Downing Street
OL,4,Afor Budget after saying gas bill
OL,5,Astanding charges will be scrapped
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey will soon leave
OL,8,F11 Downing Street and head to
OL,9,FParliament to deliver his first Budget
OL,10,F- watch live coverage above
OL,12,FEarlier, Healey announced standing
OL,13,Fcharges are to be scrapped from
OL,14,Fhousehold gas bills
OL,16,FThe move - due to take effect next year
OL,17,F"or as soon as possible" - will save
OL,18,F60% of households an average of #45 per
OL,19,Fyear, according to the Treasury
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
